{"id":"autrement","lemma":"autrement","pos":"conj","rank":1278,"glosses":["otherwise, or else"],"ipa":"/o.tʁə.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/Fr-autrement.ogg/Fr-autrement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je pense autrement.","en":"I think otherwise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2220","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},null]},{"text":"Comment pourrait-il en être autrement ?","en":"How could it be any other way?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"he / it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"to have arrived at…"]]},{"text":"Dis-le autrement.","en":"Say it in another way.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je ne peux pas faire autrement.","en":"I can't do it any other way.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to do"},null]},{"text":"J'ignore comment le dire autrement.","en":"I don't know how else to say it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to ignore","l":"ignorer"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},null]}]}